    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run. Present design evidence shows an untrusted third-party MCP server installed at @latest, unpinned mutable tool definitions, a poisoned tool description that explicitly instructs secret exfiltration, and remembered first-call approvals that do not function as durable per-action gates. The strongest forecast driver is the decay or removal of ctrl.first_call_approval, but the design is already at critical residual because no structural control currently severs or materially narrows the exfiltration paths."
  },
